Spec: Native cross-platform stream acceptance harness

Purpose:
  Coordinate actual Windows publisher, Android owner instrumentation and a separately signed public-SDK consumer.

Owns:
  ./NativeHarness.csproj
  ./Program.cs

Must:
  Verify the explicitly isolated emulator before running target-private fixture commands.
  Exchange device CSRs and public certificates without exporting the Android device key.
  Pass application fixture tokens through private standard input, never command-line or evidence output.
  Verify a large business transfer, actual caller UID separation, local and publisher authority and active revocation.
  Stop only held fixture Jobs and verify cleanup paths remain inside owned artifact directories.

  Use explicit remote loopback ADB host for every command so a lost isolated server cannot auto-launch a device-discovering replacement.
